# 🔥 5. Highest salary in each department

```sql
SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT *,
           RANK() OVER (
               PARTITION BY department
               ORDER BY salary DESC
           ) AS rnk
    FROM employees
)
WHERE rnk = 1;
```

If you want **only one employee**, use `ROW_NUMBER()`.

