# 🔥 13. Employees whose salary is greater than their manager

Self join:

```sql
SELECT
    e.name AS employee,
    e.salary AS employee_salary,
    m.name AS manager,
    m.salary AS manager_salary
FROM employees e
JOIN employees m
    ON e.manager_id = m.employee_id
WHERE e.salary > m.salary;
```

Very common interview question.

