# 🔥 24. Difference between current and previous salary

```sql
SELECT
    employee_id,
    name,
    salary,
    LAG(salary) OVER (
        ORDER BY employee_id
    ) AS previous_salary
FROM employees;
```

Calculate difference:

```sql
SELECT
    employee_id,
    name,
    salary,
    salary - LAG(salary) OVER (
        ORDER BY employee_id
    ) AS salary_difference
FROM employees;
```

