# 🔥 36. Find gaps in dates

Suppose:

```text
2026-01-01
2026-01-02
2026-01-05
2026-01-06
2026-01-10
```

Use `LAG()`:

```sql
SELECT
    order_date,
    LAG(order_date) OVER (
        ORDER BY order_date
    ) AS previous_date
FROM orders;
```

Then:

```sql
SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT
        order_date,
        LAG(order_date) OVER (
            ORDER BY order_date
        ) AS previous_date
    FROM orders
)
WHERE DATE_DIFF(order_date, previous_date, DAY) > 1;
```

