# 🔥 43. Multiple CTEs

```sql
WITH dept_avg AS (
    SELECT
        department,
        AVG(salary) AS avg_salary
    FROM employees
    GROUP BY department
),
employee_data AS (
    SELECT
        e.*,
        d.avg_salary
    FROM employees e
    JOIN dept_avg d
        ON e.department = d.department
)
SELECT *
FROM employee_data
WHERE salary > avg_salary;
```

