# 🔥 47. UNION vs UNION ALL

```sql
SELECT name FROM employees_2025
UNION
SELECT name FROM employees_2026;
```

Removes duplicates.

```sql
SELECT name FROM employees_2025
UNION ALL
SELECT name FROM employees_2026;
```

Keeps duplicates.

**Interview question:** Which is faster?

Usually **`UNION ALL`**, because it doesn't need duplicate elimination.

